Atomic Git commits

Install:
  Install the missing bundled skill and Git; preserve detected installed skill copies.

Upgrade:
  Back up and replace the installed skill with Wsley's bundled files; restore previous copies if replacement fails.

Status:
  Report skill locations based on SKILL.md presence, and the local Git version.

Requirements:
  Ubuntu, APT and a regular user with sudo access.

Configuration:
  Destination: ~/.agents/skills/git-commit
  Existing copies at ${CODEX_HOME:-$HOME/.codex}/skills/git-commit are consolidated into links to the destination when skill files are replaced.
